\[
d = 0.017\ \text{m} \cdot 0.0002909 \approx 0.000004945\ \text{m} = 4.945\ \mu\text{m}.
\]  

This result corresponds to **5 microns**, aligning with option **I**.  

**Answer is I. 5 microns**  
